 Oblivion, and the West Wind is ordered to take him there. She can't stand giving this fate to an innocent like Unico, so Unico's adventures begin, as the West Wind takes him from one place and time to the next, in a neverending journey to escape the wrath of the gods. In this adventure, Unico meets Beezel a devil child and then Katy (Chao), a cat who wants to be a witch! Can he become friends with them?\n\n(Source: AniDB)"},"tags":[{"name":"Super Power","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shoujo","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Animals","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shapeshifting","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":67,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Magic","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Henshin","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Demons","rank":57,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":56,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cosmic Horror","rank":55,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":52,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Musical Theater","rank":32,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cannibalism","rank":10,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Fantastic Adventures of Unico","english":"Fantastic Adventures of Unico","native":"ユニコ","romaji":"Unico","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"小小独角兽"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"小白角"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"神奇独角马"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}